    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ordal">Ord</ref> 5.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And ga he tó and in-seglige man þa hand, and séce man ófer þæne þriddan dǽg, swa hwæðer swa heo béo ful swa clæne binnan þam in-segle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the accused shall go to the ordeal, and his hand shall be sealed up; and after three days it shall be inspected [in order] to ascertain whether it has become discoloured or remained clean within the sealed wrappings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 inseglige man þa hand, sé[c]e man ófer þæne þriddan dǽg, swa hwæðer swa heo béo ful swa clæne binnan þam in-segle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
